<title>USA: TABLE- North European Oil Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE- North European Oil Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RED BANK, N.J. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>North European Oil Royalty Trust</p>
<p> Quarter Ended		   7/31/97			7/31/96</p>
<p> German Royalties Received $3,170,930		  $1,796,511</p>
<p> Net Income		     3,070,926		   1,674,327</p>
<p> Net Income Per Unit		 0.35			  0.19</p>
